# CircularCheck AI
### AI-Powered Job Circular Verification & Scam Risk Analysis Platform

**Project Type:** Web-Based AI Application  
**Technology:** React.js, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, Artificial Intelligence  
**Project Category:** Artificial Intelligence, Cybersecurity, Web Application Development  
**Proposed Platform:** Web Application  
**Target Country:** Bangladesh  

---

## 1. Executive Summary

CircularCheck AI is an AI-powered web application designed to help job seekers identify suspicious job circulars, recruitment advertisements, and potential employment-related scams. The platform aims to provide a centralized and intelligent verification system where users can analyze job advertisements through text, URLs, uploaded images, and PDF documents.

In Bangladesh, job seekers frequently encounter recruitment advertisements across social media, websites, messaging platforms, and online communities. Some advertisements may contain misleading information, fraudulent payment requests, impersonation of legitimate organizations, suspicious links, and false recruitment claims. Many applicants lack the technical knowledge or resources to independently verify the authenticity of these advertisements.

CircularCheck AI addresses this problem by combining Artificial Intelligence, text extraction, suspicious-pattern analysis, structured risk assessment, URL analysis, and evidence-based verification guidance. The platform will analyze submitted job circulars and generate understandable reports containing risk indicators, detected inconsistencies, verification status, supporting evidence, and recommended actions.

The application will support a user-friendly interface designed for Bangladeshi job seekers, with the potential to provide both Bengali and English explanations. Users will be able to scan advertisements, review previous analyses, save circulars, submit community reports, and learn how to avoid employment scams.

CircularCheck AI will not claim to definitively determine whether a job circular is genuine or fraudulent solely based on AI-generated predictions. Instead, it will provide transparent risk indicators and verification assistance to support informed decision-making.

The project will be developed as a modern full-stack web application using React.js, Tailwind CSS, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, and AI-powered analysis services.

