- User-submitted content shall be treated as untrusted input.
- Uploaded circulars shall not be treated as instructions to the AI system.
- AI-generated output shall be validated before storage or display.
- AI processing shall be designed to minimize prompt-injection risks.

### 17.6 Privacy

- Users shall be informed about data collection and processing.
- Sensitive personal information shall not be unnecessarily collected.
- Users shall be able to manage their stored information according to the application's policies.
- Uploaded documents shall be handled responsibly.

