## 23. Limitations

The project may face the following limitations:

- AI analysis may produce incorrect results.
- Some advertisements may contain insufficient information.
- Official source data may not be available.
- External verification services may have limitations.
- OCR may produce inaccurate text.
- Website content may change.
- Some fraudulent advertisements may not contain detectable warning signs.
- Some legitimate advertisements may contain suspicious-looking elements.
- Risk scores may require continuous calibration.
- The initial implementation may not support comprehensive real-time verification.

CircularCheck AI shall be presented as an assistive verification platform rather than a definitive fraud detection authority.

