## 25. Conclusion

CircularCheck AI is proposed as an AI-powered job circular verification and scam risk analysis platform designed to address the growing challenges faced by job seekers when evaluating online recruitment advertisements.

By combining AI-powered text analysis, structured information extraction, suspicious-pattern detection, rule-based risk assessment, source verification, and transparent reporting, the platform aims to provide users with an accessible tool for understanding recruitment-related risks.

The project will be developed using modern web technologies, including React.js, Node.js, Express.js, MongoDB, and AI-powered services. Its modular architecture will allow future expansion into advanced verification systems, community intelligence, browser extensions, and mobile applications.

CircularCheck AI will emphasize transparency, usability, security, responsible AI use, and evidence-based analysis. Rather than making definitive claims about the authenticity of advertisements, it will help users understand potential warning signs and make more informed decisions.

The project has the potential to become a practical digital safety platform for job seekers in Bangladesh while demonstrating the application of Artificial Intelligence, full-stack web development, cybersecurity principles, and responsible technology design.

